    "detailed_description": "<h1>Highlights</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/9957b9eecf55d4b1d49e96fe48823484.avif?t=1753606768\" width=600 height=132 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/6a4ff8a795d89e97df70b73a041e52a9.avif?t=1753606768\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br>Enjoy Unreal Engine 5 graphics!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/8c2f5fd391bc268d93b80a152ef8d2c7.poster.avif?t=1753606768\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/8c2f5fd391bc268d93b80a152ef8d2c7.webm?t=1753606768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/8c2f5fd391bc268d93b80a152ef8d2c7.mp4?t=1753606768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/baf9471ea5c1150b84e3205bb6b7d129.avif?t=1753606768\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br>You can use many objects to solve puzzles<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/76947ced9ed26dd9af4ddc3b82ab5a7c.poster.avif?t=1753606768\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/76947ced9ed26dd9af4ddc3b82ab5a7c.webm?t=1753606768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/76947ced9ed26dd9af4ddc3b82ab5a7c.mp4?t=1753606768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/a5153541c2ba7ed856fc7c5bf1009e3c.avif?t=1753606768\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br>Get ready to be scared as you unravel the story!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/b4f1c924f0958167537e531a1cdbfd74.poster.avif?t=1753606768\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/b4f1c924f0958167537e531a1cdbfd74.webm?t=1753606768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/b4f1c924f0958167537e531a1cdbfd74.mp4?t=1753606768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/7427ddb242022211f61aaf9773f9bf0a.avif?t=1753606768\" width=400 height=100 /></span><br>Get ready for a gripping story full of surprises.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/acedfd3aaab7653c76ecdad803dd8fea.poster.avif?t=1753606768\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/acedfd3aaab7653c76ecdad803dd8fea.webm?t=1753606768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032120/extras/acedfd3aaab7653c76ecdad803dd8fea.mp4?t=1753606768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
